                <note rend="inline" type="source">702.4193 Manchuria/11: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Neville</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-09-29T13:00:00-04:00">September 29, 1934—1
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>168. Your 216, September 28, 2 p.m., paragraphs 4 and 5. You are so
                    authorized.</p>
                <p>Inform Peiping.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
